# This project's backend needs a persistent disk for self-hosted video
# storage (see api/src/lib/videoStorage.ts) — that only works on Render,
# not Vercel's ephemeral serverless filesystem. Deploy api/ to Render only.
#
# Excluding the whole api/ folder here also prevents Vercel's zero-config
# Node.js runtime from auto-detecting every .ts file under api/ as its own
# serverless function, which is what was hitting the Hobby plan's
# 12-function limit. Vercel should only ever build/serve the frontend.
api/
